Error [E0121]: `resource` was consumed by `close`, so it can't be used here
  --> defer_close_twice.jet:12:12
    |
 12 |     close(^resource)
    |            ^^^^^^^^
  --> defer_close_twice.jet:11:18
    |
 11 |     defer close(^resource)
    |                  ^^^^^^^^ `resource` moved to `close` here
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `resource` after the move, or give `close` a copy with `resource.copy()` where it moved.
 Note: acquire a new `Resource` resource; closed resources cannot be copied or reused
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121
